s Page\n- Teams Management\n- Labels Page\n- Settings Page\n\nEach section contains detailed test cases with Initial State, Action, and Expected outcomes.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Style Guides\n**No AppStyle.md or AppRevisions.md files found.**\n\nHowever, CSS variables are used throughout the application with consistent naming:\n- `--color-bg` (background)\n- `--color-bg-surface` (surface background)\n- `--color-bg-hover` (hover states)\n- `--color-border` (borders)\n- `--color-text-primary` (primary text)\n- `--color-text-secondary` (secondary text)\n- `--color-text-tertiary` (tertiary/muted text)\n- `--color-accent` (primary accent color, Linear's purple-blue)\n\n---\n\n### 5. Database Schema (scripts/schema.ts)\n**Not found** - The app uses Neon PostgreSQL (serverless) configured via `DATABASE_URL` environment variable. Database access is abstracted through `/netlify/functions/db.ts` which uses the Neon `sql` client.\n\n---\n\n### 6. Redux Store (src/store.ts)\n\n**Store Configuration:**\n```typescript\nreducer: {\n  auth: authReducer,\n  ui: uiReducer,\n  teams: teamsReducer,\n  workspace: workspaceReducer,\n  notifications: notificationsReducer,\n  issues: issuesReducer,\n  labels: labelsReducer,\n  teamIssues: teamIssuesReducer,\n  issueDetail: issueDetailReducer,\n  cycles: cyclesReducer,\n  projects: projectsReducer,\n  projectDetail: projectDetailReducer,\n  members: membersReducer,\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### 7. Routing (src/App.tsx)\n**File does not exist** - The app uses React Router (detected in Sidebar.tsx with `useLocation` and `Link` imports). Routing is likely configured in a main entry point file that wasn't found in the src directory.\n\n---\n\n### 8. CSS Variables (src/index.css)\n**File does not exist** - CSS variables are defined and used in component-specific CSS files throughout the app. All components import their own `.css` files.\n\n---\n\n### 9. Components & Pages\n\n**Components (36 components in src/components/):**\n- ActivityComments.tsx\n- BulkActions.tsx\n- BurndownChart.tsx\n- CreateCycle.tsx\n- CreateIssueActions.tsx\n- CreateIssueForm.tsx\n- CreateIssueModal.tsx\n- CreateProjectModal.tsx\n- CycleDetail.tsx\n- CycleList.tsx\n- FiltersToolbar.tsx\n- GroupBySort.tsx\n- InviteMemberModal.tsx\n- IssueDescription.tsx\n- IssueHeader.tsx\n- IssueRow.tsx\n- IssueSidebar.tsx\n- KeyboardShortcuts.tsx\n- LoginForm.tsx\n- MemberActions.tsx\n- MemberList.tsx\n- MyIssuesList.tsx\n- NotificationList.tsx\n- NotificationRow.tsx\n- ProjectCard.tsx\n- ProjectFilters.tsx\n- ProjectHeader.tsx\n- ProjectIssuesTab.tsx\n- ProjectOverviewTab.tsx\n- Sidebar.tsx\n- SidebarCollapse.tsx\n- SignUpForm.tsx\n- SubIssues.tsx\n- TeamFilters.tsx\n- TeamIssuesList.tsx\n\n**Pages (10 pages in src/pages/):**\n- ActiveCycle.tsx\n- Inbox.tsx\n- IssueDetail.tsx\n- Login.tsx\n- Members.tsx\n- MyIssues.tsx\n- ProjectDetail.tsx\n- Projects.tsx\n- SignUp.tsx\n- TeamIssues.tsx\n\n---\n\n### 10. Redux Slices Overview\n\n**authSlice.ts**\n- State: user, token, loading, error\n- Actions: login, signup, fetchCurrentUser, logout, clearError\n- Token stored in localStorage as 'session_token'\n\n**teamsSlice.ts**\n- State: items (Team[]), loading, error\n- Actions: fetchTeams\n- Team interface: id, name, identifier, description, member_count\n\n**membersSlice.ts**\n- State: items (Member[]), currentUserId, loading, error\n- Actions: fetchMembers, inviteMember, updateMemberRole, removeMember\n- Member interface: id, name, email, role, teams[]\n\n**workspaceSlice.ts**\n- State: workspace (Workspace | null), loading, error\n- Actions: fetchWorkspace\n\n**notificationsSlice.ts**\n- State: unreadCount, items (Notification[]), loading\n- Actions: fetchUnreadCount, fetchNotifications, markNotificationRead, archiveNotification\n- Notification types: assignment, update, mention\n\n**issuesSlice.ts**\n- State: myIssues (Issue[]), loading, error\n- Actions: fetchMyIssues, createIssue, updateIssueStatus\n- Issue interface: comprehensive with all fields including labels, assignee, project, cycle, due date\n\n**labelsSlice.ts**\n- State: items (Label[]), loading, error\n- Actions: fetchLabels\n\n**teamIssuesSlice.ts**\n- State: items, members, projects, cycles, selectedIds, groupBy, sortBy, loading, error\n- Actions: fetchTeamIssues, bulkUpdateIssues\n- Supports grouping by: status, priority, assignee, project, label, none\n- Supports sorting by: priority, created, updated, status\n\n**issueDetailSlice.ts**\n- State: issue, subIssues, activity, comments, members, projects, cycles, allLabels, loading, error\n- Actions: fetchIssueDetail, updateIssueField, addComment\n- Supports ActivityEntry and Comment tracking\n\n**cyclesSlice.ts**\n- State: cycles, selectedCycleId, cycleDetail, cycleIssues, members, burndown, groupBy, sortBy, selectedIds, loading, error\n- Actions: fetchCycles, fetchCycleIssues, createCycle\n- Includes BurndownEntry tracking and bulk issue selection\n\n**projectsSlice.ts**\n- State: items, members, teams, loading, error\n- Actions: fetchProjects, createProject\n\n**projectDetailSlice.ts**\n- State: project, issues, milestones, members, labels, activity, selectedIssueIds, loading, error\n- Actions: fetchProjectDetail, updateProjectField, createMilestone, updateMilestone, deleteMilestone, updateProjectIssueStatus, bulkUpdateProjectIssues\n\n**uiSlice.ts**\n- State: sidebarCollapsed (persisted in localStorage), createIssueModalOpen, createIssueDefaultParentId, createIssueDefaultTeamId\n- Actions: toggleSidebar, openCreateIssueModal, closeCreateIssueModal\n\n---\n\n### 11. Netlify Functions (Related to Teams)\n\n**teams.ts** (`/api/teams`)\n- GET: Returns list of all teams with member counts\n- Requires Bearer token authentication\n- Queries: teams table, counts members via team_members join\n\n**team-issues.ts** (`/api/team-issues?teamId=...`)\n- GET: Returns all issues for a team with rich metadata\n- Includes: issues, labels, team members, projects, cycles\n- Enriches issues with team identifier, assignee details, 